<rml>
<head>
	<title>UMG events</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="/ArcRmlUISamples/UI/Rml/Shared/Samples.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="UmgEvents.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="ue-card">
		<h1 class="ue-title">UMG events</h1>
		<p>The buttons below ask the widget to open another document or to close. The Widget Blueprint graph decides what happens.</p>
		<div class="ue-buttons">
			<button id="ue-next" class="ue-button" data-action="open:/ArcRmlUISamples/UI/Rml/UmgEvents/Second.rml">Open the second document</button>
			<button class="ue-button" data-action="close">Close</button>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
